# Hardened Multi-Stage Dockerfile Optimization for Beacon API
**Author:** Rune Marlow  
**Department:** DevOps  
**Project:** Beacon API  
**Produced:** D12 17:00  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Optimized the Beacon API container image by implementing multi-stage builds, stripping build dependencies, and adhering to strict non-root least-privilege security baselines as referenced in the internal Company Document.

## Deliverable
```
# Production Multi-Stage Hardened Dockerfile for Beacon API
# Built in compliance with internal hardening standards outlined in 'Company Document'.

# Stage 1: Build Environment
FROM golang:1.22-alpine AS builder

# Enforce static compilation and module security checks
ENV CGO_ENABLED=0 \
    GOOS=linux \
    GOARCH=amd64 \
    GOPROXY=https://proxy.golang.org,direct

WORKDIR /build

# Verify dependencies and install build prerequisites securely
RUN apk add --no-cache ca-certificates git \
    && update-ca-certificates

COPY go.mod go.sum ./
RUN go mod download && go mod verify

COPY . .
RUN go build -ldflags="-s -w -extldflags '-static'" -trimpath -o /build/beacon-api ./cmd/beacon-api

# Stage 2: Minimal Distroless/Scratch Runtime
FROM scratch

# Security metadata as mandated by Company Document compliance rules
LABEL maintainer="Rune Marlow <rmarlow@itskokos.com>" \
      project="Beacon API" \
      security.policy="Company Document Section 4.2 Hardened Images"

# Copy SSL root certificates and hardened unprivileged user
COPY --from=builder /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt /etc/ssl/certs/
COPY --from=builder /etc/passwd /etc/passwd
COPY --from=builder /etc/group /etc/group

# Copy compiled binary
COPY --from=builder --chown=65532:65532 /build/beacon-api /app/beacon-api

# Run strictly as non-root (nobody/65532)
USER 65532:65532
WORKDIR /app

EXPOSE 8080

ENTRYPOINT ["/app/beacon-api"]
```